Comment:
 This package is NOT itself "MIT-licensed" as a whole. It bundles a Python
 venv containing several third-party projects under their own licenses,
 and can download model weights whose license terms are not fully
 verified (see the melband-roformer-kim-vocals entry below). Do not
 redistribute the built .deb (with venv/model payload included) without
 re-checking this file against the actual pinned versions used at build
 time -- versions/licenses of third-party PyPI packages can change
 between releases.

