Files: ~/.cache/melband-roformer-infer/melband-roformer-kim-vocals/MelBandRoformer.ckpt
       (downloaded at runtime, NOT shipped in the .deb payload)
Copyright: Kimberley Jensen
License: UNKNOWN
Comment: Kimberley Jensen's Mel-Band-Roformer-Vocal-Model repository (the
 origin of this checkpoint) does not carry an explicit LICENSE file/SPDX
 tag as of this writing. Treat the downloaded weights as "author retains
 all rights, redistribution/commercial-use terms unclear" rather than
 assuming MIT/permissive just because the surrounding code (this package,
 melband-roformer-infer, BS-RoFormer) is MIT. Re-check
 https://huggingface.co/KimberleyJSN/melbandroformer and
 https://github.com/KimberleyJensen/Mel-Band-Roformer-Vocal-Model directly
 before any redistribution, commercial use, or fine-tuning of these
 weights. This package only downloads them into the user's own cache on
 explicit confirmation; it never redistributes them itself.

